    {
      "handle": "billplunkett.bsky.social",
      "author": "",
      "team": "ドジャース",
      "outlet": "Southern California News Group",
      "text": "PCA joked at the All Star Game that he would need to start pitching if he was going to dethrone Shohei Ohtani as NL MVP. Turns out that wasn’t necessary. www.ocregister.com/2026/11/12/c...",
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-13T02:32:41.550Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:av2tzgjxhryyzqwurmjvk5pt/app.bsky.feed.post/3n25wz2tu7k2q",
      "jp_players": [
        "Shohei Ohtani",
        "Ohtani"
      ],
      "jp": "PCAはオールスターゲームで「大谷翔平からナ・リーグMVPを奪うなら自分も投げないと」と冗談を飛ばしていた。結局そんな必要はなかった。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "Pete Crow-Armstrong is the unanimous National League MVP. He's the Cubs' first MVP since Kris Bryant in 2016.",
      "likes": 225,
      "reposts": 36,
      "replies": 4,
      "at": "2026-11-13T00:55:22.708Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3n25rl2ij3s2u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "The way he played this year, that was the right and only choice by the voters.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "ncpix2009.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "And Bryant never had a season like this one: 45 homers, 41 steals, and the NL lead in OPS and runs (119).  First 40-40 by a Cub, ever.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "baseball44.com"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hopefully his next ten years are better then Bryant's last ten",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "rreardon.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let’s hope the rest of his career is better than Bryant’s, who has sucked since he won. And I don’t want hear about injuries, dude’s got $200 million and earned about a hunny",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "clydebscro.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "ピート・クロウ＝アームストロングが満票でナ・リーグMVPに選出。カブスでは2016年のクリス・ブライアント以来のMVP。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "Astros designated hitter Yordan Alvarez is the American League MVP. He is the first full-time designated hitter to ever win AL MVP and the third MVP in Astros franchise history.",
      "likes": 78,
      "reposts": 16,
      "replies": 5,
      "at": "2026-11-13T00:25:24.056Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:hqnn3kfpfuhkhv2b4izkrzpa/app.bsky.feed.post/3n25pvh62xc24",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Well deserved",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "nomowoe.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "He earned it at the plate: .316/.432/.601, tops in the majors in all three.  Since 1970, the only other AL batting champs with 40+ homers are Miguel Cabrera ('12 and '13) and Aaron Judge ('25).",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "baseball44.com"
        },
        {
          "text": "So fucking happy for the GOAT man. What a season to remember.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "rjb44.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Woo hoo! Yay Air Yordan! 🎉",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "peacherina.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "アストロズの指名打者ヨルダン・アルバレスがア・リーグMVPに。専任の指名打者としては史上初で、球団史上3人目のMVP。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "bastianmlb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jordan Bastian",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Pete Crow-Armstrong is the National League MVP. He is the 9th player to win the MVP (10th win overall) in Cubs history since the BBWAA began handing out the award in 1931. Crow-Armstrong 2026 Bryant 2016 Sosa 1998 Dawson 1987 Sandberg 1984 Banks 1958-59 Sauer 1952 Cavarretta 1945 Hartnett 1935",
      "likes": 77,
      "reposts": 17,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-13T00:53:07.221Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:rcetk47n6hybe57ou4m36jf6/app.bsky.feed.post/3n25rgzbskc2g",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "クロウ＝アームストロングがナ・リーグMVP。1931年にBBWAAが表彰を始めて以降、カブスでは9人目（通算10回目）の受賞。2026年クロウ＝アームストロング、2016年ブライアント、1998年ソーサ、1987年ドーソン、1984年サンドバーグ、1958-59年バンクス、1952年ザウアー、1945年カヴァレッタ、1935年ハートネット。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "Pete Crow-Armstrong caps a historic season for the Cubs with unanimous NL MVP: \"I still don’t feel satisfied with the product that I put on the field this year ... because I really know there’s more. I’ve decided there’s more. That’s how I got here.\" www.chicagotribune.com/2026/11/12/c...",
      "likes": 53,
      "reposts": 13,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-13T04:04:53.274Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2645wcogk2u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "クロウ＝アームストロングが満票のナ・リーグMVPでカブスの歴史的な1年を締めくくる。「今年の自分のプレーにはまだ満足していない…もっとやれると分かっているから。そう決めたからここまで来られた」"
    },
    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "Yordan Alvarez, the Astros’ aw shucks slugger who set a new standard for an entire position, is the unanimous winner of the AL MVP award - www.nytimes.com/athletic/776...",
