      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "More points than minutes is always decent",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "viraldonutz.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Zero turnovers is always impressive. Even more so when you play double OT, score that many points, and dish out that many assistants. Our fearless leader!",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "toddweiser.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "More than a point a minute for 48 minutes is crazy regardless of the rest of the game for sure. Also 11 assists to 0 TOs, you love to see it",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "notkimboslice.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "ケイド・カニングハムが大活躍の夜（そう、2延長戦だったのは承知の上で）。"
